    <string name="faq_title">FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq_anti_flicker">HalfRotate locks system auto-rotate while the filter is active and rotates directly between allowed orientations — no flash through blocked angles.</string>
    <string name="faq_landscape_only">Use \"Landscape only\" to stay in horizontal mode. The screen won\'t rotate to portrait while the filter is on.</string>
    <string name="faq_app_orientation">Some apps force their own orientation and may ignore system rotation. The filter applies to the Android system, which covers most apps.</string>
    <string name="faq_channels">Play Store and F-Droid builds use different signing keys. Switching stores requires reinstalling the app.</string>

